WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.434 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Happy holidays.
-Thank you. To you, as well.

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:04.337
-Thank you. Your family --
you went to the Caribbean.

00:00:04.337 --> 00:00:04.804 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-We did.

00:00:04.804 --> 00:00:07.640 align:start size:94% position:6%
We went somewhere tropical,
Turks and Caicos.

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:08.608 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Beautiful.
-Missed the Turks,

00:00:08.608 --> 00:00:10.744 align:start size:94% position:6%
