00:00:15.215 --> 00:00:16.583 line:92%
-I spent it in New Mexico.

00:00:16.583 --> 00:00:17.917 line:92%
We've talked about this before.

00:00:17.917 --> 00:00:19.085 size:88% position:44% line:92%
