00:00:22.188 --> 00:00:24.190 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I was not in the land
of enchantment.

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:26.860
-Although, I really do like
going back for Christmas.

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:28.361 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's beautiful.
-It's super beautiful.

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:31.297 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's super tranquil and flat,
they have the luminarias.

00:00:31.297 --> 00:00:35.368
You know those?
These are small brown lunch bags

00:00:35.368 --> 00:00:37.303 align:start size:94% position:6%
filled with sand and then a
little candle

00:00:37.303 --> 00:00:40.040 align:start size:94% position:6%
