And they light them.

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:41.641 line:92%
And you put them all around.

00:00:41.641 --> 00:00:43.610 align:start size:94% position:6%
-When you start,
it doesn't sound like

00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:44.511 line:92%
it's gonna end beautiful.

00:00:44.511 --> 00:00:46.312 align:start size:94% position:6%
You're like, "It's the most
beautiful thing.

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:48.448 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's a lunch bag..."
[ Laughter ]

00:00:48.448 --> 00:00:50.116 line:92%
"...and you fill it with sand."

00:00:50.116 --> 00:00:52.619 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And then you light it on fire
and then you --

00:00:52.619 --> 00:00:54.421 line:92%
-And then you ring the doorbell.

00:00:54.421 --> 00:00:57.257
-But when they're all around,
they're really quite beautiful.

00:00:57.257 --> 00:00:58.825 line:92%
-It is a very beautiful place.

00:00:58.825 --> 00:01:02.062
-How long were you there?
-I was there for 12 days.

00:01:02.062 --> 00:01:02.695 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-Oh! That's a long time.

00:01:02.695 --> 00:01:05.198 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It was with my in-Laws
who I love dearly.

00:01:05.198 --> 00:01:07.801 line:92%
12 days is a lot of days.

00:01:07.801 --> 00:01:08.368 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.368 --> 00:01:09.869 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's a lot of days
in any place.

00:01:09.869 --> 00:01:10.970 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, it really --
I think that's it,

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:12.539 size:88% position:44%
'cause I don't want this
to be about my in-laws,

00:01:12.539 --> 00:01:14.140 align:start size:94% position:6%
it's just a lot of days
in any place.

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:17.744
-You probably chose that because
you have small children.

00:01:17.744 --> 00:01:19.612 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I didn't choose.

00:01:19.612 --> 00:01:20.880 size:88% position:44% line:92%
I don't make the choice.

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:21.948 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.948 --> 00:01:24.551 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I've done New Mexico
for the holidays,

00:01:24.551 --> 00:01:27.987 size:75% position:38%
it's fun, but I like
for the New Year's,

00:01:27.987 --> 00:01:29.422 align:start size:94% position:6%
I like top to be
somewhere warm.

00:01:29.422 --> 00:01:30.757 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-Yes. I think that's --

00:01:30.757 --> 00:01:31.724 line:92%
And I think we should clarify.

00:01:31.724 --> 00:01:34.761
A lot of people, if you say
you're going to New Mexico,

00:01:34.761 --> 00:01:36.096 align:start size:94% position:6%
they say,
"Oh, at least it's warm."

00:01:36.096 --> 00:01:38.431 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's not warm.
-Not in the wintertime, no.

00:01:38.431 --> 00:01:40.300 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's freezing.
-It's freezing, yeah.

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:44.938 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's why the old Mexico
has them beat by far.

00:01:44.938 --> 00:01:48.274
-Oh, maybe that's why people
think you're talking about --

00:01:48.274 --> 00:01:49.409 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-The New Mexico.

00:01:49.409 --> 00:01:50.877 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's like they've rebranded
themselves.

00:01:50.877 --> 00:01:51.744 line:92%
-They're like, "Oh, my God."

00:01:51.744 --> 00:01:54.180
-It's actually a state
in the nation, Mr. Trump.

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:55.315 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. I'm going to
the New Mexico.

00:01:55.315 --> 00:01:58.852 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's amazing.
It's like super Cancun.

00:01:58.852 --> 00:02:00.153 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.153 --> 00:02:01.454 line:92%
But it is beautiful, and I --

00:02:01.454 --> 00:02:05.158 align:start size:94% position:6%
another thing -- this show is
a beautifully shot show.

00:02:05.158 --> 00:02:07.494
-"Series of Unfortunate Events?"
-Yeah! It's just gorgeous.

00:02:07.494 --> 00:02:09.696 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Or your show?
-This is beautiful.

00:02:09.696 --> 00:02:12.132
All the more so when you're here
and you're beautiful --

00:02:12.132 --> 00:02:15.535
No, but this is so gorgeous and
it's so funny,

00:02:15.535 --> 00:02:18.905
and well-made and three seasons.
It's wrapping up.

00:02:18.905 --> 00:02:21.141 align:start size:94% position:6%
Are you happy with
how it finished?

00:02:21.141 --> 00:02:23.643 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm sincerely just super
proud of the show.

00:02:23.643 --> 00:02:28.715 align:start size:94% position:6%
When it came to me, I was
excited by the idea

00:02:28.715 --> 00:02:31.518 align:start size:94% position:6%
that it was just covering
the canon of these 13 books,

00:02:31.518 --> 00:02:33.353 align:start size:94% position:6%
the "Series of Unfortunate
Events" books,

00:02:33.353 --> 00:02:36.089 size:88% position:44%
so it wasn't supposed to
be a series that went on

00:02:36.089 --> 00:02:36.823 size:88% position:44% line:92%
for seasons and seasons.

00:02:36.823 --> 00:02:38.291 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was just three
seasons all in.

00:02:38.291 --> 00:02:41.561
Barry Sonnenfeld, who is
spectacular and eccentric

00:02:41.561 --> 00:02:43.496 align:start size:94% position:6%
and amazing, has this really
great vision.

00:02:43.496 --> 00:02:47.000
And I got to wear crazy
prosthetics, the cast was good,

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:49.702
Netflix gives you lots of money
to create it,

00:02:49.702 --> 00:02:53.439
and then they back off and allow
you the opportunity

00:02:53.439 --> 00:02:54.607 line:92%
to just create a piece of art.

00:02:54.607 --> 00:02:57.443
So the fact that it wasn't just
"Let's hope we can get,

00:02:57.443 --> 00:03:00.413 align:start size:94% position:6%
you know, another season
or two out of it,

00:03:00.413 --> 00:03:03.516 align:start size:94% position:6%
but that we did this piece
of art, in my opinion,

00:03:03.516 --> 00:03:06.953
that can go on a shelf, and the
shelf now being streaming media,

00:03:06.953 --> 00:03:08.555 align:start size:94% position:6%
with Netflix,
if you haven't seen the show,

00:03:08.555 --> 00:03:11.024 size:88% position:44%
you can go and start at
season one, episode one,

00:03:11.024 --> 00:03:11.724 size:78% position:39% line:92%
and you can watch it.

00:03:11.724 --> 00:03:15.361 size:81% position:41%
It's for young adults,
it's for adult adults.

00:03:15.361 --> 00:03:18.131 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And it's a timeless
show that was --

00:03:18.131 --> 00:03:18.831 size:78% position:39% line:92%
It's timelessly made.

00:03:18.831 --> 00:03:21.267 align:start size:94% position:6%
It'll be as good in ten years
as it was now,

00:03:21.267 --> 00:03:22.335 align:start size:94% position:6%
which is really exciting
as well.

00:03:22.335 --> 00:03:23.403 line:92%
-That's what I think is cool.

00:03:23.403 --> 00:03:24.437 line:92%
It's different than trying --

00:03:24.437 --> 00:03:26.673 align:start size:94% position:6%
on television in the past,
at least for me,

00:03:26.673 --> 00:03:28.041 align:start size:94% position:6%
you're hoping that people
keep watching

00:03:28.041 --> 00:03:30.677 align:start size:94% position:6%
