and you're really just trying

00:03:30.677 --> 00:03:33.346 align:start size:94% position:6%
to sort of squeeze
the sponge dry.

00:03:33.346 --> 00:03:34.547 line:92%
But this didn't feel that way.

00:03:34.547 --> 00:03:37.016 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was just really proud of the
way it turned out.

00:03:37.016 --> 00:03:40.353 align:start size:94% position:6%
So the third season, the final
season, just started

00:03:40.353 --> 00:03:43.256
